title: "sunspot"
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6232-9096"
repository-code: "https://github.com/docxology/sunspot"
abstract: "Python toolkit correlating a GitHub user's commit history with solar and geomagnetic activity — sunspot numbers (SILSO), F10.7 flux, Dst and ap indices from OMNI2/NOAA SWPC. Computes lagged Pearson/Spearman correlations, Lomb-Scargle periodograms, and bootstrap CIs with heatmaps and multi-user comparison."
